WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:04.799
It goes without saying that the 2010s were
a revolutionary decade for movies.

00:00:04.799 --> 00:00:08.580
Now, though, it's time to look to the future
— and take a dive into the hottest releases

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.400
from the first year of the 2020s.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:15.460
From franchise tentpoles to long-awaited sequels
to gripping original productions, these are

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.520
the movies you can't miss in 2020.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:24.100
In 2018, A Quiet Place took Hollywood by surprise,
turning a modest $17 million budget around

00:00:24.109 --> 00:00:27.990
to pull in nearly $350 million worldwide at
the box office.

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:31.630
It's also one of the most highly acclaimed
horror films in recent years, with Rotten

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:34.450
Tomatoes granting it an overwhelmingly fresh
rating and calling it

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:38.480
"a ruthlessly intelligent creature feature
that's as original as it is scary."

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.740
So it's no wonder Paramount Pictures would
want to capitalize with a sequel.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.420
And on March 20th 2020, A Quiet Place 2 will
hit theaters.

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:49.760
While writer/director John Krasinski is confirmed
for the sequel now, it wasn't always that

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:50.260
way.

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.960
In an interview with The Ringer's The Big
Picture podcast, Krasinski said he initially

00:00:53.960 --> 00:00:57.570
didn't want to have anything to do with a
second film — but was convinced by his producer

00:00:57.570 --> 00:00:59.420
to at least jot down a few ideas.

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:00.420
He explained:

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:03.680
"After like three weeks he was like, 'Why
don't you just write this and then we'll get

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:07.880
another filmmaker?' and of course Jedi mind
tricked me into signing on to the sequel."

00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:12.020
As far as the story goes, writers Scott Beck
and Bryan Woods have told Fandango that there

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:14.010
is the potential to focus on new families.

00:01:14.010 --> 00:01:17.610
Krasinski also seemed to agree that the sequel
wouldn't be just about the Abbotts of the

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:19.380
original, telling The Hollywood Reporter:

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:22.500
"In our circumstance, the thing that the audience
loved most was the world.

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.740
That's the cool thing that you could explore
on and on."

00:01:25.940 --> 00:01:31.340
On May 1st 2020, Marvel Studios is set to
release Black Widow, its 24th MCU film and

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:33.670
the beginning of the Marvel Universe's fourth
phase.

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:38.630
During the Marvel Hall H panel at 2019's San
Diego Comic-Con, the cast and crew of Black

00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:43.260
Widow discussed the film's official announcement,
along with a few story and character details.

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:47.600
Chronologically, Black Widow will take place
between Captain America: Civil War and Avengers:

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:48.440
Infinity War.

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:52.300
As far as plot goes, specific details are
still being kept under wraps, but according

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:56.280
to its cast, the film is going to be something
of a departure from other Marvel properties.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:02:00.480
David Harbour, who plays Alexei otherwise
known as the Red Guardian spoke with Marvel

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.300
after the panel.

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:02.020
He said:

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:05.460
"It feels like an espionage movie; it's got
all these elements to it."

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:06.920
Scarlett Johansson also said:

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:09.020
"It's a little dirty; it's a little salty.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:11.240
It's bringing some realness to the Marvel
universe."

00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:16.010
Joining Johansson and Harbour are Florence
Pugh as Yelena, Natasha's fellow Black Widow

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:20.560
agent; O-T Fagbenle as Mason, a "fixer" who
apparently has "a complex relationship with

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:25.340
Natasha"; and Rachel Weisz as Melina, a character
who's previously been through the Widow program

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:26.340
five times.

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:28.500
Long live the Keanussance.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:32.760
Thanks in no small part to the ongoing success
of the John Wick series, rumors have been

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:36.150
bouncing around Hollywood about potential
sequels and reboots for everything from The

00:02:36.150 --> 00:02:37.260
Matrix to Speed.

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:42.080
One follow-up that's definitely coming, however,
is Bill and Ted Face the Music, a fantastic

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:47.720
voyage following in the radical footsteps
of 1989's Excellent Adventure and 1991's Bogus

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:48.220
Journey.

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:52.780
After many years of rumblings, Keanu Reeves
and Alex Winter officially confirmed in March

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:57.060
of 2019 that strange things were indeed afoot
at the Circle K once more.

00:02:57.420 --> 00:03:02.170
William Sadler is slated to reprise his role
as the oft-Melvined Grim Reaper, while original

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:06.270
writers Chris Matheson and Ed Solomon have
returned to pen the screenplay — and Galaxy

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:08.720
Quest director Dean Parisot is set to helm.

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:12.980
Reeves himself revealed that the plot will
catch up with a now-middle aged Bill S. Preston

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:17.430
and Theodore Logan, as they realize that adult
responsibilities like fatherhood have prevented

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:20.740
them from coming up with that universe-saving
song they were destined to write.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.120
"Excellent!"

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:27.580
Bill &amp; Ted Face the Music will be partying
on in production throughout 2019 — and is

00:03:27.580 --> 00:03:30.260
set for release on August 21st 2020.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:35.890
Author Eoin Colfer's once described his young
adult fantasy series Artemis Fowl as "Die

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:36.890
Hard with fairies."

00:03:36.890 --> 00:03:39.720
Critics, meanwhile, have called Artemis "the
new Harry Potter."

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:43.770
If those comparisons pique your interest,
good news — eight novels about this young

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:48.550
criminal mastermind's coming-of-age were published
between 2001 and 2012 for your reading pleasure.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:52.959
Or you could just wait until May 29th 2020,
when a film adaptation of the first book in

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.080
Colfer's series is slated to hit theaters.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:59.420
That first book finds the 12-year-old antihero
kidnapping a fairy in the hopes of restoring

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:01.960
his family fortune and finding his long-lost
father.

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:06.520
The Disney-produced feature stars Irish newcomer
Ferdia Shaw as Artemis, with a supporting

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:11.480
cast that includes Judi Dench, Josh Gad, and
Game of Thrones' Nonso Anozie.

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:15.640
Kenneth Branagh, best known for the Marvel's
first Thor film and a multitude of Shakespeare

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:19.650
adaptations, is in the director's chair — a
role he previously filled for Disney on 2015's

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:20.640
Cinderella.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:25.720
Let's be fair, it's probably ambitious to
talk about The New Mutants as a 2020 release.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:30.060
At this rate, assigning an actual date to
this seemingly cursed X-Men project is like

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:31.860
waiting for a toad to get struck by lightning.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:34.880
"do you know what happens to a toad when it's
struck by lightning?"

00:04:35.449 --> 00:04:39.520
After an initial trailer was released in the
bygone days of October 2017, The New Mutants

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:45.070
has been pushed back no fewer than three times,
shifting from April 2018 to February 2019,

00:04:45.070 --> 00:04:46.560
then to August 2019.

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:51.340
The recent release of Disney's post-Fox-merger
schedule, however, revealed that New Mutants

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:54.669
had been delayed yet again, all the way to
April 3rd 2020.

00:04:54.669 --> 00:04:56.260
So, what's behind the delays?

00:04:56.420 --> 00:05:00.600
By all accounts, it's not actually the quality
of the film itself — unlike Dark Phoenix,

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:03.620
New Mutants has reportedly been well-received
in test screenings.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:07.880
The movie's source comics — created in the
1980s by Chris Claremont and Bill Sienkiewicz

00:05:07.880 --> 00:05:09.770
remain unique fan favorites, too.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:13.849
The cast features up-and-comers like The Witch's
Anya Taylor-Joy and Game of Thrones' Maisie

00:05:13.849 --> 00:05:14.340
Williams.

00:05:14.480 --> 00:05:18.300
Sadly, a number of factors have been at play
in frustrating the movie's release — the

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:22.629
release of Deadpool 2, a decision to play
up the movie's horror elements, expansion

00:05:22.629 --> 00:05:26.480
of certain characters' roles, and the Earth-shaking
Disney/Fox merger among them.

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:27.900
"Bad Deadpool."

00:05:28.400 --> 00:05:32.620
With any luck, fans will actually be able
to watch The New Mutants in 2020… and hopefully,

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:37.260
it will live up to its potential as a stylish
and frightening final X-Men movie from Fox.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:42.180
Currently, very little is known about Christopher
Nolan's upcoming action epic Tenet, which

00:05:42.181 --> 00:05:45.210
is slated for release on July 17th 2020.

00:05:45.210 --> 00:05:48.821
We do know that it revolves around the world
of international espionage, and that it's

00:05:48.821 --> 00:05:52.380
shaping up to be an expensive production,
with the budget reportedly clocking in at

00:05:52.380 --> 00:05:54.380
about $225 million.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:58.800
On top of that, Tenet will be shown in IMAX,
so expect big things — literally.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:03.240
The film stars John David Washington, Aaron
Taylor-Johnson, and Robert Pattinson, among

00:06:03.240 --> 00:06:03.740
others.

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:08.400
Pattinson told USA Today in April 2019 that
he had been "sworn to secrecy" regarding Tenet's

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:08.900
details.

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:12.460
The actor was fond of the script, however,
and said that Nolan has changed his mind about

00:06:12.469 --> 00:06:13.930
doing big budget movies.

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:14.930
Pattinson explained:

00:06:14.930 --> 00:06:16.760
"There's just something about Chris Nolan's
stuff.

00:06:17.069 --> 00:06:21.560
He seems like the only director now who can
do what is essentially a very personal, independent

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:23.059
movie that has huge scale.

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:24.920
I read the script and it's unreal."

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:32.640
Pixar's newest movie Onward is set in a fantasy
suburbia and follows two elf brothers, voiced

00:06:32.649 --> 00:06:36.559
by Tom Holland and Chris Pratt, as they set
out into the world — in search of magic

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:39.040
that will allow them to spend a day with their
dead father.

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:43.780
Onward is a completely new entry to the Pixar
canon, so its imaginative world promises to

00:06:43.789 --> 00:06:45.930
be like nothing the studio has done before.

00:06:45.930 --> 00:06:49.500
And judging by the film's first teaser trailer
— which features all kinds of magical creatures

00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:52.480
— there will be more than enough for fantasy
fans to sink their teeth into.

00:06:52.580 --> 00:06:57.380
Onward is directed by Dan Scanlon, who helmed
2013's Monsters University and has worked

00:06:57.389 --> 00:07:01.919
on the senior creative team for Brave, Inside
Out, Coco, and Toy Story 4.

00:07:01.919 --> 00:07:06.069
This is a personal project for him, too — he
told the audience at D23 that the story was

00:07:06.069 --> 00:07:09.939
inspired by his own personal search for answers
regarding his father, who passed away when

00:07:09.940 --> 00:07:10.780
he was a year old.

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.660
Pixar's Onward hits theaters on March 6th
2020.

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:18.619
In addition to the rest of the MCU's Phase
4 projects, Marvel Studios president Kevin

00:07:18.619 --> 00:07:23.099
Feige took to the stage at 2019's San Diego
Comic-Con to announce Eternals, which will

00:07:23.100 --> 00:07:25.600
make its way to theaters on November 6th 2020.

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:29.439
While little is known regarding the plot of
Eternals, the film will be based on the cosmic

00:07:29.440 --> 00:07:34.060
Jack Kirby characters first introduced in
the pages of Marvel comics in 1976.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:35.160
According to Marvel:

00:07:35.460 --> 00:07:39.431
"The Eternals are a race of god-like beings
locked in a millennium-old conflict with the

00:07:39.431 --> 00:07:43.879
less evolved Deviants and their originators,
the Celestials… they are immortals blessed

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.300
with strange, sometimes monstrous, powers."

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.980
"There's a little bit of pee coming out of
me right now."

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:54.430
Eternals boasts an all-star cast, including
Angelina Jolie, Richard Madden, Kumail Nanjiani,

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:55.260
and Salma Hayek.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:08:01.780
It's directed by Chloé Zhao, whose two previous
films, 2015's Songs My Brother Taught Me and

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:05.460
2017's The Rider were both met with critical
acclaim — with The Rider being nominated

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.600
for Independent Spirit Awards for Best Film
and Best Director.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:14.139
The Call of the Wild, Jack London's 1903 adventure
novel about a sled dog's journey across the

00:08:14.139 --> 00:08:18.210
Yukon Territory, is a literary classic — just
look at how many times it's been adapted to

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:20.520
the screen, stretching all the way back to
the silent era.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.400
In the past, the lead human role of prospector
John Thorton has been played by Hollywood

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.760
tough guys like Clark Gable, Charlton Heston,
and Rutger Hauer.

00:08:27.800 --> 00:08:32.820
On February 21st 2020, however, John Thorton's
rugged boots will be filled by Harrison Ford

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:37.120
in a live-action/animation hybrid from Lilo
and Stitch and How to Train Your Dragon director

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:39.520
Chris Sanders, and Logan writer Michael Green.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:43.980
The impressive supporting cast is rounded
out by Dan Stevens, Karen Gillan, Omar Sy,

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:44.990
and Bradley Whitford.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:49.280
It remains to be seen just how Sanders' animation
expertise will bring the story's animal characters

00:08:49.280 --> 00:08:53.330
to life in this 20th Century Fox production,
but the impressive pedigree of the material

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:55.700
makes this adaptation one to keep an eye on.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:09:00.800
After years in development, the big screen
adaptation of Naughty Dog's video game franchise

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:04.660
Uncharted will finally be making it to theaters
on December 18th 2020.

00:09:04.780 --> 00:09:08.640
In 2017, it was announced that Spider-Man's
Tom Holland would be taking on the lead role

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:12.401
of Nathan Drake in Sony's prequel film, which
will star the same lead character from the

00:09:12.401 --> 00:09:14.500
game — but won't be following its plot.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:18.200
Instead, it will introduce a younger version
of Drake as he learns the tricks of the trade

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:19.360
from his mentor, Sully.

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:24.500
Bryan Cranston is also rumored to star, but
his role remains unknown at the time of publication.

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:28.650
Uncharted has run through a series of directors
over the course of its development, with Seth

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:32.910
Gordon, David O. Russell, Neil Burger, and
Shawn Levy all having been attached at some

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:33.400
point.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:38.520
Finally, in January 2019, Variety announced
10 Cloverfield Lane's Dan Trachtenberg would

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:39.520
take the reins.

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:42.940
Currently, little else is known about the
film, but if the casting rumors are true,

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:47.160
the combination of Holland and Cranston could
make for one video game adaptation that can't

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:47.840
be missed.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.900
Check out one of our newest videos right here!

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:53.240
Plus, even more Looper videos about your favorite
movies are coming soon.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.020
Subscribe to our YouTube channel and hit the
bell so you don't miss a single one.

